ndards across your Rego policies.\n4. **Syntax Validation**: Runs `opa check .` to catch syntax errors or reference errors early.\n5. **Unit Testing**: Runs `opa test . -v` to execute all defined policy unit tests and provide verbose output.\n\nMake sure to adjust the directory paths if your Rego policies are confined to a specific subdirectory (e.g., replacing `.` with `./policies`).\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I add a step to build a Docker image for the OPA pod in this GitHub Action?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I write a basic unit test for an OPA rego policy?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","chatSectionId":"0","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/lineage-event.json","language":"json","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/__init__.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/sentry_sdk/integrations/logging.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/datahub/configuration/env_vars.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/dataform-bigquery/SKILL.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcp-pipeline-orchestration/SKILL.md","lan