ow considering GCP as the deployment target, given the presence of related files. My next step is to adjust the workflow to build a Docker image, with potential integration for GCR.\n\n**Building Docker Image**\n\nMy focus has shifted to constructing a Docker image. This image will contain the OPA policy bundle, ready to be deployed as an artifact for an OPA pod within a Kubernetes environment.\n\n**Adding Deployment Job**\n\nI am now focusing on adding a new 'opa-deploy' job to the workflow, ensuring it depends on the successful completion of the validation steps. This job will execute only on pushes to the main or master branches, and I've added steps for checking out the code and setting up the OPA CLI.\n\n","id":"d86a3de4-a975-45a5-b2fb-647f81e865a2","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Flash Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-flash-preview-free-tier","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":58479,"candidatesTokenCount":798,"totalTokenCount":59277}},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"give me steps to test it ","chatSectionId":"3","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","language":"yaml","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/src/vertex/prompt_optimizer/docs/data_driven_optimize_tuning_guide.md","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pkg_resources/tests/test_integration_zope_interface.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/avro/test/test_tether_task_runner.py","language":"","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/tests/test_build_py.py","language":"","selection":{"